            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Choosing Wisely and Klug Entscheiden (KE) are recent physician-triggered campaigns that aim at identifying and reducing blatant over-treatment as well as - a specialty of KE - occurring under-treatment. This paper provides some conceptual and normative analyses of these campaigns' goals and justifications.</AbstractText>
